    {
      "alias": "N00",
      "kind": "NODE",
      "text": "节点图谱中每个 Workspace Unit 具有全局唯一 UUID 与持久化版本号；软删除仅撤回可见性而不破坏历史溯源链。 验收夹具标识 FACT-3100。",
      "provenance": {
        "repositoryPath": "docs/v2/NODE_MODEL_V2.md",
        "sourceVersion": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "N01",
      "kind": "NODE",
      "text": "澄清动作的合法性检查由 Action Eligibility 守卫独立仲裁；未就绪的前置依赖阻止模型执行分支合并。 验收夹具标识 FACT-3101。",
      "provenance": {
        "repositoryPath": "docs/v2/ACTION_ELIGIBILITY_ARCHITECTURE.md",
        "sourceVersion": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "N02",
      "kind": "NODE",
      "text": "候选生成过程中的向量距离阈值设定为 0.50；超过此距离的语义节点在初筛阶段直接剔除。 验收夹具标识 FACT-3102。",
      "provenance": {
        "repositoryPath": "docs/v2/UNIFIED_PYTHON_RAG_DESIGN.md",
        "sourceVersion": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "N03",
      "kind": "NODE",
      "text": "多工作线程调度使用 RebuildLeaseCoordinator 进行租约加锁；过期租约由后台协同器抢占并回收。 验收夹具标识 FACT-3103。",
      "provenance": {
        "repositoryPath": "docs/v2/PHASE1_MULTI_WORKER_EXECUTION_DESIGN.md",
        "sourceVersion": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "N04",
      "kind": "NODE",
      "text": "运行时模型网关对所有供应商响应实施 Fail-Closed 校验；格式不合规的结构化输出直接标记为失败。 验收夹具标识 FACT-3104。",
      "provenance": {
        "repositoryPath": "docs/v2/AGENT_RUNTIME_ARCHITECTURE.md",
        "sourceVersion": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "N05",
      "kind": "NODE",
      "text": "跨项目检索授权通过 RetrievalScopeGrant 显式下发；无当前项目授权的私有语料在 SQL 层直接阻断。 验收夹具标识 FACT-3105。",
      "provenance": {
        "repositoryPath": "docs/v2/PHASE2_IDENTITY_AUTHORIZATION_DESIGN.md",
        "sourceVersion": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "N06",
      "kind": "NODE",
      "text": "全局助手在 LangChain 架构下将会话记忆与持久化 Checkpoint 绑定；单步失败不会破坏历史有效状态。 验收夹具标识 FACT-3106。",
      "provenance": {
        "repositoryPath": "docs/v2/GLOBAL_ASSISTANT_LANGCHAIN_REDESIGN.md",
        "sourceVersion": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "N07",
      "kind": "NODE",
      "text": "词法检索通道引入 CJK Bigram 增强索引；对中文多词表达进行双字切分以保证无分词器场景下的自然语言召回。 验收夹具标识 FACT-3107。",
      "provenance": {
        "repositoryPath": "docs/v2/UNIFIED_PYTHON_RAG_DESIGN.md",
        "sourceVersion": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "N08",
      "kind": "NODE",
      "text": "嵌入向量计算由本地 Qwen3-0.6B 服务提供，固定输出 1024 维 float32 数组并通过小端字节序校验和验真。 验收夹具标识 FACT-3108。",
      "provenance": {
        "repositoryPath": "docs/v2/LOCAL_DEPLOYMENT_SERVICE_CONFIGURATION_DESIGN.md",
        "sourceVersion": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "N09",
      "kind": "NODE",
      "text": "宿主等待协议 C16-WAIT 针对未就绪的异步任务建立延期唤醒队列；超时未决则触发主动取消。 验收夹具标识 FACT-3109。",
      "provenance": {
        "repositoryPath": "docs/v2/C16_WAIT_V4.md",
        "sourceVersion": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "N10",
      "kind": "NODE",
      "text": "混合检索融合采用标准 Reciprocal Rank Fusion (RRF)，平滑常数 k 固定配置为 60。 验收夹具标识 FACT-3110。",
      "provenance": {
        "repositoryPath": "docs/v2/UNIFIED_PYTHON_RAG_DESIGN.md",
        "sourceVersion": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "N11",
      "kind": "NODE",
      "text": "节点属性的局部修订通过 AnswerPatch 增量追踪；任何历史 Patch 不得直接改写父节点原始记录。 验收夹具标识 FACT-3111。",
      "provenance": {
        "repositoryPath": "docs/v2/GRAPH_MODEL_V2.md",
        "sourceVersion": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "N12",
      "kind": "NODE",
      "text": "外部 Web 检索工具 Tavily 仅在全局助手明确授权时调用；获取的网页内容按外部证据级别标记。 验收夹具标识 FACT-3112。",
      "provenance": {
        "repositoryPath": "docs/v2/GLOBAL_ASSISTANT_SINGLE_ENGINE_AND_WEB_TOOLS_PLAN.md",
        "sourceVersion": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "N13",
      "kind": "NODE",
      "text": "项目 Agent 对当前路线的上下文重构采用线性祖先溯源；被剪枝或分叉的同级路线节点排除在上下文窗口之外。 验收夹具标识 FACT-3113。",
      "provenance": {
        "repositoryPath": "docs/v2/GRAPH_ROUTE_CONTEXT_INTEGRITY_INVESTIGATION.md",
        "sourceVersion": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "N14",
      "kind": "NODE",
      "text": "本地推理客户端向 Broker 发起调用时配置独立超时预算；超时未响应由客户端主动熔断。 验收夹具标识 FACT-3114。",
      "provenance": {
        "repositoryPath": "docs/v2/PYTHON_AGENT_RUNTIME_BOUNDARY.md",
        "sourceVersion": "1"
      }
    },
    {
      "alias": "N15",
      "kind": "NODE",
